  {
    "speaker": "雑誌記者",
    "text": "……早速ですが、取材を始めさせていただきますね",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "id": 202301201091,
    "speaker": "雛菜＆プロデューサー",
    "text": "はい、よろしくお願いします……！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 1,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/202301201/202301201091"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "雑誌記者",
    "text": "以前、お伝えした通り、\r\n市川さんを特集する全２回の短期連載を予定しています",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "雑誌記者",
    "text": "今回は、『少し先の未来』というテーマで\r\nお話を聞かせていただければと思います",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "id": 2023012010100,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "はい～、わかりました～！",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202301201/2023012010100"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "雑誌記者",
    "text": "それでは……今から２年後。高校３年生になった\r\n市川さんは、何をされていると思いますか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "id": 2023012010110,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "たぶんですけど……\r\nアイドルやりながら、受験勉強してると思います～",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202301201/2023012010110"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "雑誌記者",
    "text": "学業との両立は難しいと思いますが、\r\n受験勉強のためにお仕事をセーブする予定はありますか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "id": 2023012010120,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "……ん～\r\nまだ、わかんないですね～",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202301201/2023012010120"
  },
  {
    "id": 2023012010130,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "大学に進学したい、っていうのも\r\n今日の雛菜がそうしたいって、思ってるだけなので～",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202301201/2023012010130"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "雑誌記者",
    "text": "え……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "id": 2023012010140,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "明日の雛菜がどう思ってるかは、\r\n雛菜にもわかんないな～って、思ってます～",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202301201/2023012010140"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "雑誌記者",
    "text": "あっ、ははっ……\r\n確かにそうですね",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "id": 2023012010150,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "……？",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy_s",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202301201/2023012010150"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "雑誌記者",
    "text": "あっ、失礼しました……！\r\n確かにそうだなって、思っただけなんです",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "id": 2023012010160,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "……そうですか～",
